    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1091153924
    m_Localized: 'When the warning appears, shout the team cheer together.

      Shout
      it just like you recorded it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1091153925
    m_Localized: Set Team Cheer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1091153926
    m_Localized: 'The host records a sound,

      then everyone records it twice.

      No
      mic? Turn on "Cheer with T Key" in Options.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24992255946752
    m_Localized: Team Cheer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24992297889793
    m_Localized: ex) fighting
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24992297889794
    m_Localized: Confirm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24992297889795
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24992297889796
    m_Localized: 'Host: record the sound your team will shout.

      Any word or
      sound works (at least 0.5 s of sound, up to 3 s)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24992297889797
    m_Localized: 'Team cheer: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25143871647744
    m_Localized: "Use 2\u201312 lowercase English letters only."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25143871647746
    m_Localized: That word is a reserved system word, so you can't use it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25143871647747
    m_Localized: This contains a word that can't be used.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25143871647751
    m_Localized: Couldn't confirm the team cheer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 25143871647752
    m_Localized: Only the host can set the team cheer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53793039953920
    m_Localized: Change Team Cheer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53793073508352
    m_Localized: You can change your team cheer one last time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
